        reveal: 'Two channels, with the relay detecting a single fault, is category 3. In the ISO 13849-1 chart, category 3 with low DC and high MTTFd reaches PL d, so it meets the required level, provided the common cause measures really hold. Validation under ISO 13849-2 checks the specification, recalculates the PL and tests faults: disconnect one switch, short one channel, and check that the robot stops and won’t restart.',
