          options: ['Which rule was broken, and by whom exactly?', 'How severe should the sanction be for this?', 'Which department pays for the damage?', 'Who was hurt, and what do they need?'],
          answer: 'Who was hurt, and what do they need?',
          why: 'Rules broken and sanctions are retributive questions. Restorative looks at harm, needs and obligations.',
